  "details": "It would be great to see total hours played added to VRChat profiles, similar to how days in VRChat is already tracked.\n\nSince VRChat already logs session data on the backend (as shown by the days feature), tracking cumulative hours shouldn’t be a huge lift. A lot of players — especially those who’ve been on both Quest and PC — have no real way to gauge how much time they’ve spent in VRChat overall.\n\nIdeally it would be cross-platform and tied to the VRChat account rather than the device, so hours from Quest and PC combine into one total. Even a rough estimate would be more useful than nothing.\n\nSteam shows hours for PC players, but that misses Quest time entirely, and not everyone plays through Steam anyway. An in-game or profile-level hour counter would give the whole community a consistent way to see their playtime regardless of platform.",
